# The morning the same patio was levelled, ten metres to the east.
#
# The same twenty-five marks on the same 1.5 m by 1.25 m grid over ground of the
# same shape, picked up with an instrument two millimetres good in the vertical
# instead of twenty-one. It is here so that the finding of the gate is evidence
# rather than arithmetic somebody did in a document: the density is identical and
# the answer is not, which is what says the density was never the constraint.
#
# The horizontal figure is worse than the rover's and it does not matter. A
# surface is a function of the plan position and the level is what is read off
# it; a staff a centimetre out of position on ground falling one in eighty moves
# the level by a tenth of a millimetre.
#
# id at frame x y z method fix h-precision v-precision antenna session

